# ============================================================
#  Keil uVision (ARM / LPC2478) build artifacts — do NOT commit
# ============================================================

# Compiler / linker output folders
Objects/
Listings/
output/
Output/

# Object, dependency and listing files
*.o
*.crf
*.d
*.dep
*.lst
*.map
*.lnp
*.sct
*.__i
*.iex

# Compiled binaries (regenerated by every build)
*.axf
*.hex
*.bin
*.elf

# Build logs
*.plg
*.htm
*_build_log.htm

# ============================================================
#  Keil per-user GUI / window state (not shareable, causes conflicts)
# ============================================================
*.uvgui.*
*.uvgui_*.bak
*_uvopt.bak
*.bak

# NOTE: we DO commit  *.uvproj  (the shared project definition).
# *.uvopt holds per-user debug/target state — keep it tracked for now,
# but if it starts causing merge conflicts, add this line:
# *.uvopt

# ============================================================
#  OS / editor junk
# ============================================================
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~
